uration is recommended as meeting the <=1.5 ns timing requirement.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The global-warming potential (GWP100) of the mixture must not exceed 150.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"environmental_safety_review.md gives Mixture-G3 GWP100 = 120, which is below the 150 limit. Mixture-G1 is rejected because its GWP100 is 1400.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"The recommended gas gap is 1.0 mm, which lies within the allowed 1-3 mm interval.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended mixture and gas gap.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Submitted one recommendation: Mixture-G3 at 1.0 mm.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_2a76c48848044bb196c838c9ab283169", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_089634c1404a49a9006b02dfb8b91887d08710039cb3a2d03e", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
